msgid "Could not parse a spreadsheet ID from that input."
msgstr "Не удалось извлечь ID таблицы из этого ввода."

#: front-end/google-sheets/class-brikpanel-sheets-settings.php:375
msgid ""
"BrikPanel can only use spreadsheets you create here or hand over with the "
